<title>USA: Chubb to buy back up to 17.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Chubb to buy back up to 17.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>WARREN, N.J. 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chubb Corp said Friday its board has approved a new share repurchase program in which the company would buy back up to 17.5 million shares or about 10 percent of its common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>The new program replaces a smaller program in effect since 1994, it said.</p>
<p>It said purchases will be made from time to time in the open market or in private transactions.</p>
